<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Autonomist Party (Dalmatia)</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Autonomist Party was a political party in the Austrian Kingdom of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dalmatia">Dalmatia</a>, founded in the 1860s, that opposed union with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/croatia">Croatia</a> and defended Dalmatia's separate status and the place of Italian language and culture. Supported mainly by Italian-speaking townspeople and some Slav Dalmatians, it dominated the Dalmatian diet until 1870 and kept control of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zadar">Zadar</a> into the 20th century.</p></div>
